OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 29 JUL
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FSue Lawley presents the Six
OL,7,Fo'Clock News for the final time.
OL,8,
OL,9,FIn fact, this would be Sue's final time
OL,10,Fpresenting a BBC TV news programme. She
OL,11,Fhad been a BBC news presenter for 4
OL,12,Fyears and 10 months.
OL,13,
OL,14,FSue was leaving BBC staff to go
OL,15,Ffreelance, after 18 years with the BBC.
OL,16,FShe ended her final Six o'Clock News as
OL,17,Ffollows:
OL,18,
OL,19,F"That's it from the Six o'Clock News
OL,20,Ffor this week. So it's goodnight from
OL,21,FNick and goodbye from me. Goodbye."
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
