OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 29 JUL
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1988FLaurie Mayer presents the One
OL,7,Fo'Clock News (BBC One) for the first
OL,8,Ftime.
OL,9,
OL,10,CG2022FJon Mitchell presents an ITV
OL,11,FYorkshire weather bulletin for the
OL,12,Ffinal time.
OL,13,
OL,14,FHe joined Yorkshire TV (as it was then
OL,15,Fknown) in 1989 and presented over
OL,16,F70,000 weather forecasts.
